{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-22a1c7b3-ae02-4061-8415-cee942dae75a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad3d0d64a56f73ef","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-8006-_ao2k5ka/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-8006-E006.md","content":"# Konflux build onboarding for kagenti-operator image\n\n## Description\n\nOnboard the kagenti-operator container image to the Konflux build pipeline with\nFIPS-compliant Go compilation on a UBI9 base. The image is a Go binary built from the\n`opendatahub-io/kagenti-operator` midstream fork. Konflux onboarding has lead time and\nis the critical-path item for the release, so it proceeds immediately and does not wait\nfor upstream functional validation.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Convert the Dockerfile to the multi-stage pattern used by other RHOAI Go operators\n  (rhods-operator, model-registry-operator): builder stage compiles with\n  `CGO_ENABLED=1` and `GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`; production stage copies the\n  binary onto `ubi9/ubi-minimal`.\n- Add `rpms.lock.yaml` for RPM lockfile pinning and `go.sum` for Go dependency locking.\n- Apply container security requirements: non-root execution (`USER 65532:65532`\n  following the distrotest convention), capability dropping\n  (`capabilities.drop: [\"ALL\"]`), `seccompProfile.type: RuntimeDefault`.\n- Submit and track the Konflux onboarding request for the kagenti-operator component;\n  validate the pipeline through to a green build.\n- Multi-arch: AMD64 is required for Tech Preview; include arm64 only if the pipeline\n  supports it without additional effort.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- The kagenti-operator container image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for\n  FIPS compliance (binary linked against OpenSSL, no statically-linked Go crypto).\n- The Konflux build pipeline produces a green build for the kagenti-operator image.\n- Image builds run as non-root with capabilities dropped and RuntimeDefault seccomp\n  profile.\n- AMD64 builds succeed; arm64 status is documented (included if free, otherwise\n  deferred).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- P0: Operator images built via Konflux with FIPS-compliant Go compilation\n  (`GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`, `CGO_ENABLED=1`) on UBI9 base (RFE acceptance\n  criterion).\n- P2 (partial): Multi-arch builds — AMD64 required for TP.\n- Covers strategy acceptance criteria 1 (Konflux-built image available) and 4\n  (check-payload FIPS pass).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":84655,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-84864ca943d127bf","agent_id":"a178eccc3072bed73","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"b90c9638-f818-41cd-a5f9-6d943f96d6d0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:07:50.236Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8006"}
