llation, enablement, and image contract documentation | Implementation (docs-authoring) | Docs | P0 |\n56\t\n57\tBranch epics (conditional, not standalone Jira issues):\n58\t\n59\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority | Gate |\n60\t| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n61\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-BRANCH-B-E013 | Konflux onboarding for additional AuthBridge variants (envoy, lite) | Implementation (konflux-onboarding) | Kagenti | P1 | E002 outcome B |\n62\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-BRANCH-B-E014 | OTEL trace sink integration for agent workloads | Implementation | Kagenti | P1 | E003 outcome B |\n63\t\n64\t## Dependency DAG\n65\t\n66\t```mermaid\n67\tgraph TD\n68\t    E001[RHAISTRAT-8006-E001 Upstream readiness investigation]\n69\t    E002[RHAISTRAT-8006-E002 AuthBridge variant investigation]\n70\t    E003[RHAISTRAT-8006-E003 OTEL scope investigation]\n71\t    E004[RHAISTRAT-8006-E004 Midstream fork onboarding]\n72\t    E005[RHAISTRAT-8006-E005 License validation]\n73\t    E006[RHAISTRAT-8006-E006 Konflux: operator image]\n74\t    E007[RHAISTRAT-8006-E007 Konflux: AuthBridge proxy image]\n75\t    E008[RHAISTRAT-8006-E008 DSC component controller]\n76\t    E009[RHAISTRAT-8006-E009 OLM/CSV packaging]\n77\t    E010[RHAISTRAT-8006-E010 Dashboard BFF plugin]\n78\t    E011[RHAISTRAT-8006-E011 QE E2E suite]\n79\t    E012[RHAISTRAT-8006-E012 Documentation]\n80\t\n81\t    E001 --> E008\n82\t    E004 --> E006\n83\t    E004 --> E007\n84\t    E004 --> E008\n85\t    E005 --> E008\n86\t    E008 --> E009\n87\t    E008 --> E010\n88\t    E008 --> E011\n89\t    E009 --> E011\n90\t    E004 --> E012\n91\t    E005 --> E012\n92\t    E006 --> E012\n93\t    E007 --> E012\n94\t    E008 --> E012\n95\t    E009 --> E012\n96\t    E010 --> E012\n97\t    E011 --> E012\n98\t```\n99\t\n100\tBranch DAG (attached to their gating Investigations, not part of the main plan):\n101\t\n102\t```mermaid\n103\tgraph TD\n104\t    E002[RHAISTRAT-8006-E002 AuthBridge variant investigation]\n105\t    E003[RHAISTRAT-8006-E003 OTEL 