s named additional variants).\n49\t- If additional variants are selected, the outcome triggers the conditional\n50\t  build-onboarding work for those variants; if proxy-only, that work is confirmed as\n51\t  deferred to a later release.\n52\t\n53\t## HLR Traceability\n54\t\n55\t- Directly qualifies the P1 HLR \"AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with\n56\t  FIPS compliance\": the proxy variant is committed regardless; this investigation\n57\t  determines whether additional variant onboarding epics exist.\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-93a87d1d04a08942","agent_id":"aa33879fc1b0e063d","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"e4420ff1-dab6-4200-a59e-b26fac068be9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:16:04.047Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-92f4177ae352ae7c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
