), `seccompProfile.type: RuntimeDefault`.\n50\t- Submit and track the Konflux onboarding request for the kagenti-operator component;\n51\t  validate the pipeline through to a green build.\n52\t- Multi-arch: AMD64 is required for Tech Preview; include arm64 only if the pipeline\n53\t  supports it without additional effort.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- The kagenti-operator container image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for\n58\t  FIPS compliance (binary linked against OpenSSL, no statically-linked Go crypto).\n59\t- The Konflux build pipeline produces a green build for the kagenti-operator image.\n60\t- Image builds run as non-root with capabilities dropped and RuntimeDefault seccomp\n61\t  profile.\n62\t- AMD64 builds succeed; arm64 status is documented (included if free, otherwise\n63\t  deferred).\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- P0: Operator images built via Konflux with FIPS-compliant Go compilation\n68\t  (`GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`, `CGO_ENABLED=1`) on UBI9 base (RFE acceptance\n69\t  criterion).\n70\t- P2 (partial): Multi-arch builds — AMD64 required for TP.\n71\t- Covers strategy acceptance criteria 1 (Konflux-built image available) and 4\n72\t  (check-payload FIPS pass).\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-93a87d1d04a08942","agent_id":"aa33879fc1b0e063d","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"cab26ad2-8929-4f86-a23b-e20f8a785f0a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:16:11.598Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9f39ee04eed4087","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
