oarding chain applies\n34\t(repo-onboarding + license-validation parallel → konflux-onboarding → general\n35\timplementation). The midstream fork `opendatahub-io/kagenti-operator` is stated to exist\n36\tbut its sync state needs validation; the kagenti-extensions fork status is unstated, so\n37\trepo-onboarding covers establishing/syncing both forks.\n38\t\n39\t## Epic List\n40\t\n41\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n42\t| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n43\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E001 | Validate upstream kagenti-operator readiness and midstream fork state | Investigation | Kagenti | P0 |\n44\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E002 | Determine AuthBridge sidecar variant set for Tech Preview | Investigation | Kagenti | P1 |\n45\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E003 | Resolve OTEL trace sink scope for Tech Preview | Investigation | Kagenti | P1 |\n46\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E004 | Establish and sync opendatahub-io midstream forks for kagenti repos | Implementation (repo-onboarding) | Kagenti | P0 |\n47\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E005 | License validation for kagenti-operator and kagenti-extensions transitive dependencies | Implementation (license-validation) | Kagenti | P0 |\n48\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E006 | Konflux build onboarding for kagenti-operator image | Implementation (konflux-onboarding) | Kagenti | P0 |\n49\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E007 | Konflux build onboarding for AuthBridge proxy sidecar image | Implementation (konflux-onboarding) | Kagenti | P1 |\n50\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E008 | KagentiOperator DSC component controller in rhods-operator | Implementation | Platform / ODH Operator | P0 |\n51\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E009 | OLM/CSV packaging with RELATED_IMAGE entries for disconnected install | Implementation | Platform / ODH Operator | P1 |\n52\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E010 | Dashboard BFF plugin and feature flag for agent views | Implementation | Dashboard | P1 |\n53\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E011 | E2E test plan and suite for kagenti component lifecycle | Implementation | QE | P1 |\n54\t| RHAISTRAT-8006-E012 | Installation, enablement,