48\t- Validate the CSV against OLM requirements and the operator certification criteria\n49\t  (operator productization includes OLM and certification per the strategy's in-scope\n50\t  list).\n51\t- Verify the disconnected-installation path: images resolve from a mirrored registry\n52\t  through the RELATED_IMAGE environment variables.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- The CSV declares the KagentiOperator CRD, the required RBAC, and\n57\t  `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` / `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` entries with\n58\t  SHA256-pinned digests available at packaging time.\n59\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring, when the\n60\t  kagenti-operator component is `Managed`, the operator and AuthBridge images resolve\n61\t  from the mirrored registry and the Deployment runs with mirrored images.\n62\t- The bundle passes OLM validation and is on track for operator certification.\n63\t\n64\t## HLR Traceability\n65\t\n66\t- P1: OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation.\n67\t- Covers strategy acceptance criterion 7 (disconnected installation).\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f9c3a8967f78be5","agent_id":"ae9bc348bba6a12a4","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"496508b0-b467-4911-96c3-433ab8ae4430","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:23:54.366Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a30cbd51a1338c0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
