uirements, and the card structure,\n54\t  documenting the current upstream contract (the A2A-vs-simpler-format question is\n55\t  runtime scope tracked separately and does not change this documentation's basis\n56\t  without an upstream change).\n57\t- Tech Preview labeling, limitations, and support-ability notes for the agent\n58\t  discovery feature.\n59\t- Documentation for the disconnected/air-gapped installation path using image\n60\t  mirroring.\n61\t\n62\t## Acceptance Criteria\n63\t\n64\t- Documentation covers the minimal image contract for creating a discoverable agent\n65\t  (endpoint format, health check, card structure).\n66\t- Documentation covers enabling and disabling the kagenti-operator via DSC, including\n67\t  upgrade behavior for existing clusters (component defaults to Removed).\n68\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented component and\n69\t  validated for accuracy against the delivered behavior.\n70\t- Disconnected installation instructions are included and reviewed.\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- Supports the P0 Tech Preview HLR (explicit opt-in, documented) and the strategy MUST\n75\t  acceptance criterion \"Documentation covers the minimal image contract for creating a\n76\t  discoverable agent\".\n77\t- Note: this epic's P0 priority is derived from the strategy's overall Critical\n78\t  priority via the docs-authoring priority exception; it does not push priority\n79\t  upstream to the implementations it depends on.\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f9c3a8967f78be5","agent_id":"ae9bc348bba6a12a4","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"35304d25-6551-4cca-9fc5-219ecb7977f8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:24:03.684Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-872cb24ef0b42321","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
