l/controller/components/registry/`) so the DSC controller manages it, wired\n  to the controller pipeline delivered by the follow-on controller work.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- The `KagentiOperator` CRD is defined in the\n  `components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1` group following the existing component\n  CRD pattern, and the DSC CR schema carries the kagenti component field.\n- The component defaults to `Removed` in DSC (Tech Preview opt-in) — upgrade of an\n  existing cluster changes nothing.\n- The component is registered in the component registry and recognized by the DSC\n  controller's component iteration.\n- The CRD and DSC schema changes merge with unit tests covering schema validation and\n  the `Removed` defaulting.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- P0: Operator enabled/disabled via DataScienceCluster CR following the standard\n  component controller pattern — CRD/schema/registry definition half (RFE acceptance\n  criterion).\n- P0: Tech Preview maturity with explicit opt-in, disabled by default in DSC —\n  schema-level default (RFE acceptance criterion).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":61795,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f9c3a8967f78be5","agent_id":"ae9bc348bba6a12a4","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"2bb3e5db-77ff-46c3-9b5e-15af48a5b216","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:36:11.463Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
