midstream forks; document this in the fork README/contribution\n50\t  notes.\n51\t- Define the pinned-commit strategy the platform manifest integration will use to pull\n52\t  upstream manifests.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Both midstream forks exist under opendatahub-io, are synced with their upstream\n57\t  repositories, and any sync divergence is documented.\n58\t- The fork sync process is established and documented (mechanism and cadence).\n59\t- The upstream-first contribution workflow is documented in both forks.\n60\t- Upstream manifests are retrievable from the forks at pinned commits.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- P0: Upstream-first policy — significant changes go to `kagenti/*` repos before being\n65\t  pulled into `opendatahub-io/*` midstream forks (RFE acceptance criterion).\n66\t- Enables the P0 Konflux-build HLR and the P1 AuthBridge HLR (builds source from these\n67\t  forks); satisfies the \"Midstream forks in opendatahub-io\" internal dependency.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f648cd401ef5cc9","agent_id":"af9f81e901d4d4be6","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"48fdec5f-d979-4024-ae13-c9a3b73e4c70","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:43:42.492Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bab4aaf0c1a8093e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
