{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a43184283129548","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E006\n3\ttitle: Konflux build onboarding for kagenti-operator image\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\timplementation_type: konflux-onboarding\n10\tdependencies:\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E004\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 0\n19\t  human_process_gates: -1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 6\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Konflux build onboarding for kagenti-operator image\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tOnboard the kagenti-operator container image to the Konflux build pipeline with\n35\tFIPS-compliant Go compilation on a UBI9 base. The image is a Go binary built from the\n36\t`opendatahub-io/kagenti-operator` midstream fork. Konflux onboarding has lead time and\n37\tis the critical-path item for the release, so it proceeds immediately and does not wait\n38\tfor upstream functional validation.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Convert the Dockerfile to the multi-stage pattern used by other RHOAI Go operators\n43\t  (rhods-operator, model-registry-operator): builder stage compiles with\n44\t  `CGO_ENABLED=1` and `GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`; production stage copies the\n45\t  binary onto `ubi9/ubi-minimal`.\n46\t- Add `rpms.lock.yaml` for RPM lockfile pinning and `go.sum` for Go dependency locking.\n47\t- Apply container security requirements: non-root execution (`USER 65532:65532`\n48\t  following the distroless convention), capability dropping\n49\t  (`capabilities.drop: [\"ALL\"]`), `seccompProfile.type: RuntimeDefault`.\n50\t- Submit and track the Konflux onboarding request for the kagenti-operator component;\n51\t  validate the pipeline through to a green build.\n52\t- Multi-arch: AMD64 is required for Tech Preview; include arm64 only if the pipeline\n53\t  supports it without additional effort.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- The kagenti-operator container image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for\n58\t  FIPS compliance (binary linked against OpenSSL, no statically-linked Go crypto).\n59\t- The Konflux build pipeline produces a green build for the kagenti-operator image.\n60\t- Image builds run as non-root with capabilities dropped and RuntimeDefault seccomp\n61\t  profile.\n62\t- AMD64 builds succeed; arm64 status is documented (included if free, otherwise\n63\t  deferred).\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- P0: Operator images built via Konflux with FIPS-compliant Go compilation\n68\t  (`GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`, `CGO_ENABLED=1`) on UBI9 base (RFE acceptance\n69\t  criterion).\n70\t- P2 (partial): Multi-arch builds — AMD64 required for TP.\n71\t- Covers strategy acceptance criteria 1 (Konflux-built image available) and 4\n72\t  (check-payload FIPS pass).\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f648cd401ef5cc9","agent_id":"af9f81e901d4d4be6","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"6480a5e6-aabb-48fa-aa2b-b97359030254","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:43:44.852Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a43184283129548","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
