{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a34095e4d48be177","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E007\n3\ttitle: Konflux build onboarding for AuthBridge proxy sidecar image\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\timplementation_type: konflux-onboarding\n10\tdependencies:\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E004\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 0\n19\t  human_process_gates: -1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 6\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Konflux build onboarding for AuthBridge proxy sidecar image\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tOnboard the AuthBridge proxy sidecar container image (the default `authbridge-proxy`\n35\tvariant, built from the `opendatahub-io/kagenti-extensions` midstream fork) to the\n36\tKonflux build pipeline with FIPS-compliant Go compilation. The proxy handles TLS\n37\ttermination and must use FIPS-approved cipher suites. This is the minimum viable\n38\tsidecar set for Tech Preview; additional variants are handled as conditional work\n39\tgated by the variant-set decision.\n40\t\n41\t## Scope\n42\t\n43\t- Build the `authbridge-proxy` image from the kagenti-extensions midstream fork with a\n44\t  Konflux component, following the same multi-stage FIPS pattern as other RHOAI Go\n45\t  sidecars: `CGO_ENABLED=1` with strict FIPS runtime settings on a UBI9 base.\n46\t- Add `rpms.lock.yaml` and `go.sum` lockfiles for the component.\n47\t- Apply container security requirements (non-root user, dropped capabilities,\n48\t  RuntimeDefault seccomp profile).\n49\t- Submit and track the Konflux onboarding request; validate the pipeline through to a\n50\t  green build.\n51\t- Multi-arch: AMD64 required for Tech Preview; arm64 only if the pipeline supports it\n52\t  without additional effort.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- The AuthBridge proxy sidecar container image passes Konflux `check-payload`\n57\t  validation for FIPS compliance.\n58\t- The Konflux build pipeline produces a green build for the authbridge-proxy image.\n59\t- Image builds run as non-root with capabilities dropped and RuntimeDefault seccomp\n60\t  profile.\n61\t- AMD64 builds succeed; arm64 status is documented.\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- P1: AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance (RFE\n66\t  acceptance criterion).\n67\t- P2 (partial): Multi-arch builds — AMD64 required for TP.\n68\t- Covers strategy acceptance criterion 5 (AuthBridge check-payload FIPS pass).\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f648cd401ef5cc9","agent_id":"af9f81e901d4d4be6","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"981b4886-67cf-4bfd-ad47-4d4a1af670b0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:43:45.946Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a34095e4d48be177","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
