{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc4d356eead87ba7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E009\n3\ttitle: OLM/CSV packaging with RELATED_IMAGE entries for disconnected install\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: AI Core Platform\n6\tteam: Platform / ODH Operator\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E008\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E015\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 0\n18\t  external_dependency: 0\n19\t  human_process_gates: -1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 5\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# OLM/CSV packaging with RELATED_IMAGE entries for disconnected install\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tAdd the kagenti-operator component to the ClusterServiceVersion: RELATED_IMAGE entries\n36\tfor the operator and AuthBridge proxy images (SHA256-pinned), the KagentiOperator CRD\n37\tdeclaration, and the RBAC the component controller needs to manage kagenti-operator\n38\tresources. This enables disconnected/air-gapped installation with image mirroring via\n39\tOLM relatedImages. This work builds against the component CRD and controller RBAC\n40\tproduced by the platform integration; the image digests themselves are configuration\n41\treferences filled in at execution time and do not gate the start of this epic.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- Add `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` and `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` entries\n46\t  (SHA256-pinned) to the CSV; leave a documented extension point for additional\n47\t  AuthBridge variants in future modes.\n48\t- Declare the `KagentiOperator` CRD and the component controller's RBAC in the CSV.\n49\t- Validate the CSV against OLM requirements and the operator certification criteria\n50\t  (operator productization includes OLM and certification per the strategy's in-scope\n51\t  list).\n52\t- Verify the disconnected-installation path: images resolve from a mirrored registry\n53\t  through the RELATED_IMAGE environment variables.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- The CSV declares the KagentiOperator CRD, the required RBAC, and\n58\t  `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` / `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` entries with\n59\t  SHA256-pinned digests available at packaging time.\n60\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring, when the\n61\t  kagenti-operator component is `Managed`, the operator and AuthBridge images resolve\n62\t  from the mirrored registry and the Deployment runs with mirrored images.\n63\t- The bundle passes OLM validation and is on track for operator certification.\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- P1: OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation.\n68\t- Covers strategy acceptance criterion 7 (disconnected installation).\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f648cd401ef5cc9","agent_id":"af9f81e901d4d4be6","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"6c18c29b-cb24-46b9-91c2-f133250d9e29","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:43:51.337Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc4d356eead87ba7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
