PS runtime, UBI9 base)\n50\t  as the AuthBridge proxy onboarding.\n51\t- `rpms.lock.yaml` and `go.sum` lockfiles per component.\n52\t- Multi-arch consistent with the proxy variant (AMD64 required; arm64 only if free).\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Each selected additional variant has a green Konflux build and passes\n57\t  `check-payload` FIPS validation.\n58\t- Image builds run as non-root with dropped capabilities and RuntimeDefault seccomp\n59\t  profile.\n60\t\n61\t## HLR Traceability\n62\t\n63\t- Extends the P1 AuthBridge HLR to the selected variant set; P2 multi-arch as for the\n64\t  proxy variant.\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f648cd401ef5cc9","agent_id":"af9f81e901d4d4be6","session_id":"7408e02f-2a40-4c49-b134-f5e8ed6e24cb","uuid":"8c2304e3-63f4-46d8-a6e3-634e88cdeaa8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:44:01.859Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-af1413f9580074b6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
